WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:04.380
You saw the hottie. yeah?

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:06.640
Do you mean
the E-Rank? I sure did!

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.680
His body is ridiculous.

4
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.890
He has an average face. but he
does kinda lean toward cute.

5
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.980
Guy looks scrawny till he takes
his shirt off. then it's like. oh. damn.

6
00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:21.150
When did we admit
a patient as ripped as that?

7
00:00:21.230 --> 00:00:22.780
Not ringing any bells for me.

8
00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.910
He didn't really
stand out much at first.

9
00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:31.370
apparently he started exercising.
though. and it did his body good.

10
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:35.540
There's no way. Takes more than
a couple of days to build up muscle.

11
00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:38.920
Excuse me. Mister Jinwoo Sung...

12
00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:43.960
Huh? I'm sorry.

13
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.810
No. my fault entirely.
so. please. don't be!

14
00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:51.850
His muscles... are incredible!

15
00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.150
Was he always this hot?

16
00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.270
I mean. surely he was. right?

17
00:00:57.350 --> 00:00:59.810
Do you...
need something from me?

18
00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:01.440
Oh. yes!

19
00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:04.780
I just came to see how you're feeling
since you're being discharged today.

20
00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.070
I'm honestly feeling pretty good.

21
00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.280
That's wonderful.

22
00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.200
Stop by reception whenever you're ready
and we'll get your paperwork filed. okay?

23
00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.510
Sure. Thank you for everything.

24
00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:18.750
-Oh. and...
-What?

25
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.670
If it's all right. may I have your
phone number before you go?

26
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.830
You want my phone number?

27
00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:27.180
Yes... long as you
don't mind. of course.

28
00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:30.180
Must have a test result or
two they still need to send me.

29
00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:31.930
Yeah. that's not a problem.

30
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:39.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

31
00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.900
Hello. and good morning. everyone!

32
00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.400
Joining us today.
we have a very special guest.

33
00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.070
I'm Yoonho Baek and I run
the White Tiger Guild.

34
00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.950
As one of just seven S-Rank
hunters in the entire country.

35
00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.080
I imagine your schedule stays pretty
full. so I appreciate you fitting us in.

36
00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.660
Apart from talk show
appearances and gate exploration.

37
00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.880
what exactly is a hunter's life like?

38
00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:28.550
Busy. for sure. There's
lots of training involved.

39
00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:30.920
Hunters are gifted.
but far from perfect.

40
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.880
Getting out of touch with the feel
of combat can dull our instincts.

41
00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:35.640
no matter how enhanced they are.

42
00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:39.020
So you train every day?
That must be exhausting.

43
00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:42.520
In my case. no. Before I became
a hunter I was a firefighter.

44
00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:45.190
so staying in good shape
was just routine.

45
00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:48.980
My comrades' lives are at stake. Not
being at my best could mean the worst.

46
00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:51.610
That thought alone
keeps me on my toes.

47
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:53.030
That's some motivation.

48
00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:56.660
-The White Tiger Guild...
-Oh. crap. is that the time?

49
00:03:58.820 --> 00:04:00.490
Hey. Jinwoo?

50
00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:02.160
G'morning. Jinah.

51
00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.700
Oh what? You're already up.

52
00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.880
Been awake a while now.
Have fun at school.

53
00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:12.920
There are leftovers from last night's
dinner in the fridge. if you're hungry.

54
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.350
Okay so. have you been working out?

55
00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:18.010
Uh... yeah. a little.

56
00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.010
You also look a lot taller.
which is weird.

57
00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.310
Abs. I can understand. but height?

58
00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:25.900
It's kinda cool! I guess that
even guys in their 20s can grow!

59
00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.740
I'll see ya later.

60
00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:35.370
Hey. hey...
don't forget an umbrella.

61
00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.630
No. that's heavy and it's so nice out.

62
00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.200
Yeah. look up the word "heavy"
when you get to class.

63
00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.660
Aw. gimme a break.

64
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:43.580
It's better to be safe than sorry.

65
00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:44.840
All right!

66
00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.210
Gee. thanks. Bye. pushy!

67
00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.960
Be careful out there.

68
00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.390
I'll save the running for later.

69
00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:59.430
Man. I really am jacked.
Talk about a stat boost.

70
00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:03.480
Bet I could become a bodybuilder
if I keep investing points in strength.

71
00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:08.150
Speaking of. I've got
some points to divvy up.

72
00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:11.150
But where. that is the question.

73
00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:13.360
Strength raises the damage I can do.

74
00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:16.410
But that's pretty useless
if I can't land any hits.

75
00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.740
Agility should help with that.

76
00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:20.700
I'll definitely increase those two.

77
00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:22.660
Can't go wrong with vitality either.

78
00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:26.250
Perception has come in handy.
but intellect...

79
00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:29.260
seems magic related.
so do I really need it?

80
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.300
Okay. I've got it.

81
00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.930
That looks good.

82
00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:36.890
Huh?

83
00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:39.300
Oh. Hello. Jinwoo Sung speaking!

84
00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:40.890
You finally picked up.

85
00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:43.430
I'm so sorry. been stuck
in the hospital. sir.

86
00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:46.020
I take it you're calling
to ask about the rent. right?

87
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.100
Right. Still waiting on
this month's payment.

88
00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.440
But I can push it back
if money's tight.

89
00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:54.020
N-No need!
I'll send it right away!

90
00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.360
Oh. I'll keep an eye out. then.

91
00:05:56.440 --> 00:05:58.110
You take care of yourself.
now. young man.

92
00:05:58.190 --> 00:06:00.080
I will. thank you. sir.

93
00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:05.960
I don't know if this change I'm going
through is a re-awakening or what.

94
00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:10.500
But. now that I'm able to slay
goblins without almost dying.

95
00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.130
making rent shouldn't be too hard.

96
00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.720
That said. it won't
exactly be easy either.

97
00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:23.010
Bottom line. if I wanna earn good money.
I have to go through higher ranked gates.

98
00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:28.020
Trouble with that is no sane person'll let
an E-Rank hunter just cruise into those.

99
00:06:28.720 --> 00:06:30.940
Maybe I'll get reevaluated.

100
00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.940
A higher rank could let me
access better gates

101
00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:35.620
and make some extra cash
just from the publicity.

102
00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:39.360
Uh. might get
too much publicity. though.

103
00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:42.400
Re-awakenings
are newsworthy as it is.

104
00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:45.830
But a hunter who can level up
and get stronger by the day?

105
00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:47.380
That's unheard of.

106
00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.910
I can practically see the headlines.
All eyes would be on me.

107
00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.920
And the nail that sticks out
gets hammered down.

108
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.220
No.

109
00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:59.010
I think it'd be for the best
to keep my secret to myself.

110
00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:03.470
At least. until I have
a solid grasp on this power.

111
00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:17.570
Confirm.

112
00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:21.320
Hey. there!

113
00:07:22.320 --> 00:07:25.200
-The name's Dongsuk Hwang.
-And mine's Jinwoo Sung.

114
00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.370
-E-Rank. right?
-Yes. sir.

115
00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:31.160
Oh. hey. you're him! The dude
that's. like. known for being horrible.

116
00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.880
If memory serves. you're called
"The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind."

117
00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.920
-Are you serious!
-That's enough out of both of you.

118
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.880
So much for starting
things off on the right foot.

119
00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:44.420
No. it's fine. E-Ranks can be
laughably bad. Will that be an issue?

120
00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.100
Not as far as I'm concerned.

121
00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:49.770
We need you to meet the quota. and
that's more important than your rank.

122
00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:52.890
I told you over the phone. but
you're mainly here for the headcount

123
00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:56.190
since we need a minimum of eight
hunters to enter a C-Rank dungeon.

124
00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:59.860
Half the party has to be C-Rank.
too. but we've got that covered.

125
00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.900
You aren't gonna be fighting in there. so we
won't be sharing any of the spoils with you.

126
00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.580
You'll still get your two million
for participating. though.

127
00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.120
Not bad. eh?

128
00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:13.240
Four C-Ranks and two sub-D-Ranks.

129
00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:16.550
Not bad at all. Just tell me
what I have to do. sir.

130
00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.050
You'll be in charge
of hauling our bags.

131
00:08:19.130 --> 00:08:23.630
They've got food. spare clothing. gear.
first aid kit's somewhere in there. too.

132
00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.810
First aid? There isn't
a healer on this squad?

133
00:08:26.890 --> 00:08:29.010
Independent parties like ours
have a hard time

134
00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:31.390
retaining healers.
as I'm sure you can imagine.

135
00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:34.640
We do all our raids without
a healer. so we're used to it.

136
00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.150
Huh.

137
00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:39.360
A strike squad with nothing
but tanks and damage dealers.

138
00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:41.230
Are they crazy?

139
00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:43.940
Going in without a healer
really bugs me.

140
00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:47.040
Just sign on the dotted line.
and we can be on our way.

141
00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:52.870
"I recognize the party is not liable for
anything that occurs inside the dungeon."

142
00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:53.950
Sure.

143
00:08:54.030 --> 00:08:55.920
-Here.
-Thank ya.

144
00:08:58.120 --> 00:09:01.000
Hello there.
fellow temporary recruit!

145
00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.340
My name's Jinho Yoo.

146
00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:06.850
I'm a 21-year-old D-Rank hunter. and I
signed up as a quota guy. just like you!

147
00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.140
I see.

148
00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:10.140
A D-Rank with that gear?

149
00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:12.760
Is this kid a trust fund baby?

150
00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:15.270
It's your first C-Rank raid ever?

151
00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:18.240
Huh! Don't you worry.
I'll be there to keep you safe!

152
00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.570
Awesome.

153
00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:24.270
Let's move out!

154
00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:27.570
Those bags look really heavy.
think that you'll be okay?

155
00:09:27.650 --> 00:09:29.660
Yes. but. thank you.

156
00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:33.960
Oh. come on. bro. I'm younger than you. so
just drop all the "please" and "thank-yous."

157
00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.040
Works for me.

158
00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:39.250
Did you hear about the president of
the firm who was handling this site?

159
00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:43.170
He fled overseas two months ago
with the 900 billion he embezzled.

160
00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.140
while the workers and investors
were left holding the bag.

161
00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:50.300
Ahh. Just look at me rambling
without reading the mood again.

162
00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:54.470
For some strange reason. I've never been
great at picking up on social cues. ever.

163
00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:57.980
Here we are.

164
00:09:58.060 --> 00:10:00.900
Damn! That is one huge. swirly light!

165
00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:03.400
Don't see gates this big very often.

166
00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:07.530
We really don't. which makes me
feel like it should be ranked higher.

167
00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:08.820
You know what I mean. boss?

168
00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:12.240
The Association folks said it was
a C gate after checking it twice.

169
00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:14.240
and they're pretty thorough
about that stuff.

170
00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:18.000
C-Rank or not. a gate with its
own postal code seems bad. right?

171
00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.370
The size of the gate doesn't
really tell us anything.

172
00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:24.210
The magic power within it is what
counts so I think we'll be just fine.

173
00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.380
When Mister Hwang said. "they checked it".
he meant they measured its magic.

174
00:10:28.460 --> 00:10:31.510
We wouldn't even be allowed
to raid it if it were B or higher.

175
00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:34.630
larger guilds handle
the more dangerous dungeons.

176
00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:37.350
Hm. your brain's kinda
blowing mine away. Jinwoo.

177
00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.810
I may be an E-Rank. but I
have been doing this awhile.

178
00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:44.270
Don't get cocky.
It's still your first C-Rank raid.

179
00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.490
Okay. follow me. we're goin' in!

180
00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:47.610
Yes. sir!

181
00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.160
Steel yourself. and let's go!

182
00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:53.200
Yeah. right behind you.

183
00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.120
Huh!

184
00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.160
Hey. Gyu-hwan. a little light?

185
00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.790
Sure.

186
00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.300
Well. this is different.
no beasts to greet us?

187
00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:09.220
Awfully dark for a dungeon. too.

188
00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:12.630
Yeah. where are the glow stones
in the walls that light the way?

189
00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:14.220
A pitch-black dungeon.

190
00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:16.480
Reminds me of the Cartenon Temple.

191
00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:21.060
Hey. quick question. What
did he mean by "glow stones?"

192
00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.180
Oh... they're shiny rocks.

193
00:11:23.260 --> 00:11:27.570
It's common to find them all over the
ground and walls of cave-like dungeons.

194
00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.150
They give off this faint light
that illuminates the area.

195
00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:32.530
I wouldn't mind
having a few right now.

196
00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:36.870
So. an essence stone is the kind
you recover from a magic beast.

197
00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:39.870
a mana stone is what you can
mine from the dungeon itself.

198
00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:43.500
and then there's a glow stone that has
a more practical use of lighting caves.

199
00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:45.420
Seems easy to mix them up.

200
00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.640
You'll get the hang of it soon enough.

201
00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:54.300
What if it's a bust? Just a big.
empty cave. What d'you think?

202
00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.470
Could a dungeon without a
single magic beast even exist?

203
00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:58.230
Quiet.

204
00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:02.890
I hear them. they found us.

205
00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.770
They just haven't
shown themselves yet.

206
00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.360
Everyone ready?

207
00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:12.190
What moves as a group. lives in the dark.
but is drawn to light when they sense it?

208
00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:14.860
We're dealing with insect-types!

209
00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:17.370
-Insects?
-Damn it. no wonder it's dark!

210
00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:20.410
-What do you see over there. boss?
-Buncha nothin'. they're hiding!

211
00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:22.410
Don't tell me it's an ant colony!

212
00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.080
Great. now you went and jinxed us!

213
00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.630
The sound's getting closer!

214
00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:26.920
Where the hell are they?

215
00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.700
Too many tunnels to choose!

216
00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.020
There!

217
00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:35.940
-Kyuhwan!
-On it!

218
00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:40.680
-I'll draw their attention away!
-Right!

219
00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:43.600
Stick with me. Jinwoo.
I'll keep you safe from these things!

220
00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:48.950
What are you waiting for. huh?
Come get me!

221
00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:53.360
He got every creepy crawly
to head straight for him!

222
00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:56.210
A taunt skill. no wonder he's C-Rank.

223
00:12:58.240 --> 00:13:00.330
Hey. on your left. Jinsuk!

224
00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.160
Yeah. I got 'em!

225
00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:03.870
-I'll help!
-No. just stay back!

226
00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.420
I'm counting down!

227
00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:11.000
Five. four. three. two. one. zero!

228
00:13:11.080 --> 00:13:12.800
Have a piece of this!

229
00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:17.550
Very nice. now. finish it!

230
00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.350
Aw. hell. yeah!

231
00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:23.970
Nice chemistry. they've obviously
been working together for a long time.

232
00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:30.400
Still. since they operate without a
healer. they're a little too aggressive.

233
00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:35.440
And Jinho. his fancy gear
makes up for his lack of skill.

234
00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.450
Everyone's doing fine. I guess.

235
00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:43.830
But...

236
00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:48.380
something feels off.

237
00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.880
That the last one? Well?

238
00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.170
Yeah. that was all of 'em.

239
00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.970
-We're done here. you guys.
-Then it's looting time!

240
00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.930
Gather up the essence stones
and divide the lot by seven!

241
00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:02.930
Yes. sir!

242
00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:05.650
This is my favorite part of the job.

243
00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.020
Same.

244
00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:09.150
That was some call you made. Jinwoo.

245
00:14:09.230 --> 00:14:11.150
Those bugs about ambushed us.

246
00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.350
Glad to help.

247
00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.360
How were you able to tell they
were attacking us from above?

248
00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.700
-Instinct.
-Huh.

249
00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:20.860
Then your instincts are
very sharp. We'd be dead!

250
00:14:20.940 --> 00:14:23.360
Hey. boss. get a load of this!

251
00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:25.240
The wounds on these bugs.

252
00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.080
No weapon of ours made those.

253
00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:30.250
Exactly. And they're not
burns from magic. either.

254
00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:32.830
I'm not sure what did this.
but they weren't just killed.

255
00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.290
these suckers were torn apart.

256
00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.090
Maybe they had a turf battle
with some other magic beasts.

257
00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:40.260
Which implies that there's
a more dominant creature

258
00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:43.470
than these freaks crawling
around in here somewhere.

259
00:14:43.550 --> 00:14:44.880
Huh...

260
00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.570
What could be big enough
to prey on these.

261
00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.350
That was amazing!

262
00:14:50.430 --> 00:14:53.350
Like. did you see me slash
that one bug down the middle?

263
00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:54.770
Yeah.

264
00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:58.320
So your sword. and all of your
armor. bet they weren't cheap.

265
00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:01.610
Uhh. you're right.
they were a gift from my dad.

266
00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:04.200
He wanted to honor
my first raid and all.

267
00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.410
Well. just make sure
to watch your back.

268
00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:09.290
I get the sense we'll need to.

269
00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:18.170
Six. seven. Eight. nine. and... ten!

270
00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.590
Whoa! Did a bomb just
go off in our building?

271
00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:25.140
Settle down. that's
a standard occurrence here.

272
00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:28.790
It's just the Guildmaster training.

273
00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:36.530
That much damage from one hit?

274
00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:38.010
Damn.

275
00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:42.990
Well. that didn't get me
anywhere near warmed up.

276
00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:45.790
Hey. can I get
a clean-up crew in here?

277
00:15:48.700 --> 00:15:50.500
We there yet?

278
00:15:50.580 --> 00:15:53.910
-The size of a dungeon has nothing to--
-Nothing to do with its rank. right?

279
00:15:53.990 --> 00:15:57.130
I was listening when you
talked about magic power ratings.

280
00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:00.340
Does that mean this dungeon
is vast but mostly empty?

281
00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:01.670
Sure does.

282
00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.560
Dude. it must be hard lugging
around all that stuff in this huge place.

283
00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.970
Really. bro.
I don't mind helping you.

284
00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:10.100
They're really not
as heavy as you would think.

285
00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:14.890
I'm also getting paid without fighting
magic beasts. which is a pretty sweet deal.

286
00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.480
Or at least I thought it was.

287
00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.780
Now. it seems too sweet.

288
00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:23.030
What's this nagging feeling?

289
00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:27.620
We're a battle-tested party.
without a healer.

290
00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.870
And they needed extra members.

291
00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:33.210
Another half-dead one.

292
00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:36.710
-Nice!
-Thanks.

293
00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.710
Something's up with this place.

294
00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:42.670
We've covered a ton of ground. but none
of the beasts we've come across are healthy.

295
00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:45.640
Every insect since that first
swarm has been injured or dead.

296
00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.970
There's a boss in here
somewhere. there's gotta be.

297
00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:50.810
A gate wouldn't have
opened if there wasn't.

298
00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:54.010
Hang on. Kyuhwan.
light the way ahead.

299
00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.520
Sure.

300
00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.230
This path definitely
leads to the boss chamber.

301
00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:03.780
Stay alert!

302
00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:18.130
-Jackpot!
-No way.

303
00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:22.000
Look at all of these mana crystals!
They're just so beautiful!

304
00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:25.040
They aren't worth as much as
essence stones. but this haul?

305
00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.970
It's gotta be worth billions.
if not more!

306
00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:31.970
Y'know. Boss. I bet even your brother
would be jealous of a find like this!

307
00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:37.110
Dude! Shut up! Why did you have to
bring up the boss' brother. huh? Not cool!

308
00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:39.940
Dongsoo. what'd I tell you?

309
00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:42.730
You don't always get
to be the one who's right.

310
00:17:42.810 --> 00:17:46.080
Better not expect your big
brother to bow down to you now.

311
00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:50.990
'Cause this score is just the thing
to make my strike team blow up!

312
00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:55.410
Once we split this seven ways. no doubt
it's gonna be over a 100 million each!

313
00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:56.710
But how are we gonna carry it all?

314
00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.960
Hey. Jinwoo. can I see the contract that
you signed before entering the dungeon?

315
00:18:00.040 --> 00:18:01.880
There's something I wanna
double-check for you.

316
00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.470
Okay.

317
00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:07.050
Excuse me. Mister Hwang. sir?

318
00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:09.930
According to Jinwoo's contract.
he should be in on this.

319
00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:12.840
Battle drops are the only
things he doesn't get a share of.

320
00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.350
Since mana crystals are excavated
as opposed to being dropped by beasts.

321
00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:19.810
shouldn't this particular find be
split eight ways instead of seven?

322
00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.600
Well. of course.
let's split it all evenly!

323
00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.600
Fair is fair. after all.

324
00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:26.110
But first...

325
00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:28.700
There's some
company we should see to.

326
00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.820
The dungeon boss!

327
00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:34.410
In case you didn't know. rookie. the
gate will close once that thing dies.

328
00:18:34.490 --> 00:18:36.750
Mining and carrying out
this truckload of crystals

329
00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:40.210
comes before exterminating
the colossal spider.

330
00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:45.680
Fortunately. it seems to be asleep. which
gives us the perfect chance to excavate.

331
00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:47.590
So. where's the gear?

332
00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:52.010
I mean. I wasn't expecting there to
be a treasure trove of mana crystals.

333
00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:54.970
I left all of the transport and
mining tools back with my ride.

334
00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:58.310
Chul-jin. don't I always say
be prepared for anything?

335
00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:01.060
-I'm really sorry.
-Guess it can't be helped now.

336
00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.770
Why don't you two stay here
for a bit and protect our prize.

337
00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:06.280
-We'll go get the mining equipment.
-Wh... Stay here?

338
00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.990
This is the boss' lair.
we have the lowest ranks!

339
00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:10.610
You'll be just fine.

340
00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:13.490
That thing looks like it's
sound asleep on a full stomach.

341
00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.790
I doubt anything could snap it
awake unless you did it intentionally.

342
00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.210
Even so!

343
00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.910
This is your first raid. yet
you think you know better?

344
00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:24.460
Jinwoo's in the same boat since
this is his first C-Rank dungeon.

345
00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:26.970
Have a little faith. will ya?

346
00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:28.840
Take a break.

347
00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:31.590
Actually. I need a break
with my team. too.

348
00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:33.170
Got lots to discuss.

349
00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:37.190
Regulations say you need eight
members to take on a C-Rank dungeon.

350
00:19:38.140 --> 00:19:40.440
Their squad only consists of six.

351
00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:44.980
We do all our raids without
a healer. so we're used to it.

352
00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.280
"Used to it".
suggests they've taken on

353
00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:49.990
a fair share of C-Rank dungeons
before this one.

354
00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:54.300
So why recruit Jinho and me instead
of having regular temps on call?

355
00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.870
All right...

356
00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:00.580
go ahead and seal off the
entrance to the lair. Kyuhwan.

357
00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:08.090
No! No!

358
00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:10.920
Considering the timing.
I think they just betrayed us.

359
00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.960
I knew it. those bastards.

360
00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:17.520
In a hunter's line of work.
you run into some real crooks.

361
00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:21.890
Our job will always have some risk.
mistakes and accidents are bound to happen.

362
00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:24.270
But since those accidents
occur inside gates.

363
00:20:24.350 --> 00:20:26.900
it's easy for anyone with
ill intent to commit a crime

364
00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:29.780
and then never see
their offense come to light.

365
00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:32.690
It's not like there are
surveillance cameras in there.

366
00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:35.650
And without living witnesses
there's zero evidence.

367
00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.910
Sometimes weak people
get used as bait

368
00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:41.540
to lure out the magic beasts.
or they get left behind.

369
00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:43.160
Cast aside.

370
00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:45.370
The way lizards lose their tails.

371
00:20:46.540 --> 00:20:48.630
They're really trying to kill us.

372
00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.510
All because they want
more lousy mana crystals?

373
00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:53.800
If I...

374
00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:57.970
If I hadn't brought up that stupid
contract. then maybe we'd...

375
00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:00.850
No. we were in their trap.

376
00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:05.510
They were ready to strike us down
on the spot after one wrong move.

377
00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.150
More importantly.

378
00:21:09.730 --> 00:21:12.480
Jinwoo. I said I would protect
you. so that's what I'll do!

379
00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:14.730
Somehow. I'll manage!

380
00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:16.660
We could get out
from there if we needed.

381
00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:18.580
But I bet they thought of that too.

382
00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:29.010
A C-Rank boss. an E-Rank hunter.

383
00:21:30.170 --> 00:21:32.170
This thing's on a whole other level.

384
00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:40.140
Other level?

385
00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:41.680
No.

386
00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:44.800
I take that back.

387
00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:48.230
Jinho. don't move.
I'm gonna fight this thing.

388
00:21:48.310 --> 00:21:51.440
Wait. you mean like fight-fight?

389
00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.550
I mean this one's mine.

390
00:22:01.305 --> 00:23:01.422
